    "check 1:N check_lines; line 0:N check_modifiers; check 1:N payments (this example one card tender).",
    "Each card payment maps to one capture. Refunds reference original tender, dated separately. Many captures/refunds share a daily payout.",
    "Daily closing and recipe usage rows aggregate many checks. Never join their full amount to each check and sum again.",
    "Daily tip allocations are pooled across all collected staff tips. No deterministic one-check-to-one-employee tip ownership is claimed.",
    "The recipe usage cost is a whole daily component issue; this one check contributes line quantity times recipe raw quantity, not the whole daily cost."
